{"openapi":"3.0.0","info":{"version":"1.2.0","title":"UK Pricing API","description":"---\nVersion History\n\n1.1.0\n+ Added Individual MPAN properties ProfileClass, MeterTimeswitchClass, LineLossFactorClass, DuosTariffId, and MhhsMigrated to /electricprices and /prompts.\n\n+ Now supports both legacy and post-MHHS format Top Lines. Elements will be extracted where present, but otherwise must be provided in new properties to make quotes possible for suppliers that require them.\n\n1.2.0\n+ Added ElectricSupply.ForcedRateStructure - Applicable for MHHS-Migrated meters where SSC is empty. Only some Suppliers support pricing via this method.\n"},"servers":[{"description":"SwaggerHub API Auto Mocking","url":"https://virtserver.swaggerhub.com/POWWR/UkPricingAPI/1.2.0"},{"url":"https://udcoreapi.co.uk/Service.svc/web"}],"paths":{"/electricprices":{"post":{"summary":"Fetch electricity prices","description":"Returns a collection of electric Rate Information based for a given set of electric suppliers and settings.","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GetElectricRates"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"default":{"description":"not available","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GetElectricRatesResultWrapper"}}}}},"x-codegen-request-body-name":"GetElectricRatesWrapper"}},"/gasprices":{"post":{"summary":"Fetch gas prices","description":"Returns a collection of gas Rate Information based for a given set of electric suppliers and settings.","requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GetGasRates"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"default":{"description":"not available","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/GetGasRatesResultWrapper"}}}}},"x-codegen-request-body-name":"GetGasRatesWrapper"}},"/ping":{"get":{"responses":{"default":{"description":"not available","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/P